# ============================================================
# FOREST-RESERVE CLASS AREA BY PHU AND SABAH PEAT EXTENT
#
# Calculates forest-reserve area by FR_CLASS for:
#
#   1. Total area of each PHU
#   2. DoA peat extent in each PHU
#      Sapi, Klias, Sipitang and Usukan soil associations
#   3. SFD peat extent in each PHU
#      Klias and Sipitang soil associations
#   4. Total Sabah DoA peat extent
#   5. Total Sabah SFD peat extent
#
# Also calculates:
#   - area outside mapped forest reserves;
#   - percentage of each extent in each forest class;
#   - total area inside and outside forest reserves;
#   - area-reconciliation checks;
#   - audits of SO_ASSOCIA and FR_CLASS values.
#
# The script repairs invalid geometries before spatial overlays.
# It does not assume that the spatial geometry column is named
# "geometry".
# ============================================================


